{"query":"Birla Estates Private Limited  official site amenities","follow_up_questions":null,"answer":null,"images":[],"results":[{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/birla-niyaara-facilities-worli-south-mumbai-npxid-r383092","title":"Birla Estates Birla Niyaara Amenities - Worli, Mumbai - 99acres.com","content":"Birla Niyaara plans to deliver amenities like clubhouse, swimming pool, gym, landscaped gardens, children's play area, 24x7 power backup and gated security.","score":0.8036831,"raw_content":null,"id":"ed059a-00"},{"url":"https://www.birlaestateshomes.com/project/birla-estates-sector-71-gurgaon/index.html","title":"Birla Estates Sector 71 Gurgaon","content":"Birla Estates Pvt. Ltd., a subsidiary of Century Textiles and Industries Ltd., is a part of the globally respected Aditya Birla Group. Known for its innovative approach, sustainable developments, and customer-first values, Birla Estates has quickly established itself as one of India’s leading real estate developers. The upcoming launch at Sector 71, Gurugram is a part of its vision to expand its luxury residential footprint across key micro-markets in NCR.\n\nResidents of Birla Estates Sector 71 Gurgaon will enjoy world-class amenities curated to elevate everyday living. The project is planned with a grand clubhouse, landscaped greens, swimming pools, a fitness center, indoor and outdoor sports arenas, kids’ play areas, and community spaces that promote a balanced lifestyle. [...] Entertainment and wellness come alive with facilities such as a mini-theatre, yoga and meditation zones, and dedicated areas for sports like cricket and badminton. The presence of sustainable features, high-end security, and premium interiors makes this a future-ready development.\n\nBirla Gurgaon Location Map\n\nThe biggest USP of Birla Estates Sector 71 Gurgaon is its unbeatable location. Situated bang on Southern Peripheral Road, the project enjoys smooth connectivity to NH-48, Sohna Road, Dwarka Expressway, and Golf Course Extension Road. [...] Birla Bund Garden Pune Logo\n\n# Birla Estates Sector 71 Gurgaon\n\nBirla Gurgaon Park\nBirla Gurgaon Swimming Pool\nBirla Gurgaon Play Ground\nBirla Gurgaon Gym\n\nBirla Estates, the real estate arm of the prestigious Aditya Birla Group, is all set to launch its latest luxury residential project, Birla Estates Sector 71 Gurgaon. Spread across 5 acres of prime land right on Southern Peripheral Road (SPR), this pre-launch development is poised to redefine modern living in Gurugram. With thoughtfully designed 2, 3 and 4 BHK luxury apartments, the project blends comfort, style, and functionality, catering to families, professionals, NRIs, and investors seeking premium residences in one of NCR’s fastest-growing corridors.","score":0.767847,"raw_content":null,"id":"b0014a-01"},{"url":"https://www.birlaojasvi.ind.in/birla-estate-ongoing-project-in-ncr.html","title":"Birla Estate Ongoing Project In Ncr | Price Trends | Property Rates","content":"Its top amenities include a clubhouse, sports courts/rooms, and a swimming pool. The ongoing projects by Birla Estates in NCR and other cities are lavish","score":0.7409441,"raw_content":null,"id":"4555a9-02"},{"url":"https://www.birlaestates.com/mumbai.aspx","title":"Buy Residential & Commercial Properties in Mumbai | Birla Estates","content":"It features spacious residences, vibrant retail, and 50+ lifestyle amenities. Hill-side and river views meet excellent connectivity to Thane, Navi Mumbai","score":0.71040785,"raw_content":null,"id":"21f186-03"},{"url":"https://birlaestate.net","title":"Birla Estate","content":"Project Amenities · SWIMMING POOL · KIDS PLAY AREA · PARK PAVILIONS · OUTDOOR FITNESS STATION · CHILDREN'S PARK · PICNIC ZONE · SKATING RINK · LAWN TENNIS","score":0.66229486,"raw_content":null,"id":"badb35-04"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/birla-estates-projects-in-gurgaon-bcffid","title":"Birla Estates Projects in Gurgaon - 99acres.com","content":"Buyers get amenities such as Swimming Pool, Gymnasium and Club House in this project Brochure … ₹26.2K/sqft onwards","score":0.6609831,"raw_content":null,"id":"107960-05"},{"url":"https://www.birlaestates.com","title":"India's Top Luxury Real Estate Developers & Builders - Birla Estates","content":"## About Us\n\nAs an ever-evolving enterprise, Birla Estates carries forth the esteemed Birla legacy of excellence into Real Estate with LifeDesigned® homes and workspaces built on the values of trust and transparency.\n\nTeam Brainstorming\n\n## Our Philosophy\n\nLifeDesigned® is our guiding philosophy - Thoughtful Design\nLifeDesigned® is our guiding philosophy - Landscaped Green Spaces\nLifeDesigned® is our guiding philosophy - Lifestyle Amenities\nLifeDesigned® is our guiding philosophy - Environmentally Conscious\n\nLifeDesigned® is our guiding philosophy of drawing inspiration from and influencing the lives we touch through our built environments which are meticulously perfected to understand, nurture and enrich your life from now till forever.\n\n## Testimonials [...] Diversification in to Chemicals\n\n## 1974\n\nEntered the cement sector with Century Cement. Expanded through Maihar Cement, Manikgarh Cement & Sonar Bangla Cement\n\nEntered in the Cement Sector\n\n## 1984\n\nForayed into pulp and paper.  \nToday, production capacity of  \n3.42 Lac MT per annum.\n\nForayed into Pulp and Paper\n\n## 1994\n\nSet-up its first vertically integrated  \ncotton yarn unit equipped  \nwith 24,960 spindles.\n\nSet-up its first vertically integrated Cottom Yarn Unit\n\n## 2008\n\nSet-up a 100 acre textile  \nmill in Bharuch.\n\nSet-up a 100 acre Textile Mill in Bharuch\n\n## 2016\n\nMarked foray into real estate  \nwith Birla Estates.\n\nMarked foray into Real Estate with Birla Estates.\n\n## About Us [...] ### Birla Anāyu\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nBirla Estate Anayu, Malabar Hills, Mumbai\n\n### Silas at Birla Niyaara\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nSilas at Birla Niyaara, Worli Mumbai\n\nTotal number of customers\n\nArea Under Development\n\n## Our Legacy\n\nFor over a hundred years, Birla has powered the engines of growth that has built the nation.  \nFrom pre-independence to post-liberalisation, our values and commitment have made us leaders across diversified businesses.\n\n## 1951\n\nTook over the Century textile mills  \nbusiness which was originally set  \nup in 1897\n\n1951 - Century Textile Mills\n\n## 1956\n\nInaugurated  \nCentury rayon set-up\n\nInauguration of Century Rayon Set-up\n\n## 1964\n\nDiversified into  \nchemicals, Mumbai\n\nDiversification in to Chemicals\n\n## 1974","score":0.6347929,"raw_content":null,"id":"38b3e1-06"},{"url":"https://birla-group.in","title":"Birla Estate Sector 150 Noida | Upcoming Residential by Birla Group","content":"Golf Facilities - 25+ World-class Amenities … enjoy closeness to known schools, hospitals, IT parks, shopping malls, and entertainment hubs. 24/7 Security &","score":0.58664185,"raw_content":null,"id":"dc3690-07"}],"response_time":3.55,"request_id":"0caecf28-5c2b-4438-86f1-10e5d4854ebb"}